        "description": {
            "value": "<p>Embracing your devilish nature, you've grown accustomed to changing your appearance to deceive others. If you are @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.Doomed] when you assemble a disguise to [[/act impersonate]], you gain a +2 circumstance bonus to your Deception checks to interact with someone while disguised and to the DC for observers to detect your disguise. Additionally, you can cast 3rd-rank @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Illusory Disguise] as a divine innate spell once per day.</p>"
